    {
      "id": "claim_88724e08210746908d05c600a8bc36b6",
      "statement": "hx-gate-tests proves each repository gate still fails on the case it guards by breaking that thing and asserting a non-zero exit, on the principle that a check which cannot fail looks like coverage and is not.",
